  "reason": "The existing evidence shows config_001 (singleprofile) achieves 0.4348 validation accuracy. This experiment tests multiprofile (profile_setting=multiprofile) with the same RNA (scgpt) and image (imagenet_vit_l) encoders as config_001, but changes aggregation from None to avgpool and keeps fusion as concat. This isolates the effect of profile setting while maintaining other variables, helping determine if multiprofile improves performance. It balances exploration of a key design choice (profile setting) with minimal changes to other components."
